      "output": "REQUIREMENTS.md has been written to the project root. Here's a summary:\n\n**Feature**: About Page for Stellar Horizons (`/about`)\n\n**Key decisions made based on codebase analysis**:\n- The `/about` route already exists in `navLinks.ts` but has no page implementation — this fills that gap\n- Page reuses existing UI components (Hero, FeaturesGrid, MissionStrip, CtaBanner, SectionWrapper) to maintain consistency\n- All content is static (no API calls) — team members, milestones, and values stored as constants in `packages/ui/src/constants/`\n- Layout follows the same pattern as LandingPage and ContactPage (dark theme, 1200px max-width, Ant Design grid)\n\n**8 capabilities scoped** (P0: route, story, mission/values, team, responsive, accessibility; P1: milestones, CTA banner)\n\n**6 user stories** with Given/When/Then acceptance criteria covering navigation, content sections, and CTA flow\n\n**5 open questions** documented for product owner (specific team members, milestones, values content, background imagery, stats/metrics)",
