      "output": "SPEC.md has been created in the project root. Here's a summary of the specification:\n\n### Key Architectural Decisions:\n1. **Reuse existing UI components** (Hero, MissionStrip, FeaturesGrid, CtaBanner, SectionWrapper) for consistency and faster delivery\n2. **Static constants** for all data (team members, milestones, values) — no API needed\n3. **Ant Design Timeline** for milestones section — already in the dependency tree\n4. **New TeamCard component** in `@space-tourism/ui` — the only new reusable component needed\n\n### What's Specified:\n- **4 Mermaid diagrams**: System architecture, user flow, component data flow, and sequence diagram\n- **4 ADRs**: Component reuse, static data approach, Timeline selection, TeamCard as shared component\n- **Complete component specs** for AboutPage and TeamCard with props, accessibility, and error handling\n- **Testing strategy**: 14 unit tests, 6 E2E scenarios targeting 60/30/10 split\n- **File structure**: 8 new files, 3 modified files across `packages/ui`, `apps/web`, and `e2e`\n- **Bundle impact**: Estimated 12–19KB incremental, well under the 50KB budget\n- **4-phase implementation checklist**: Foundation → Components → Page Assembly → Integration & Testing",
      "error": null,
